# Single-page app fallback.
#
# React Router owns /login, /admin, /pharmacist, /storage and /contact, but those
# paths do not exist as files. A static host asked for /admin directly - a refresh,
# a bookmark, a shared link - would return 404 without this rule.
#
# 200 rewrites rather than redirects: the browser keeps the requested URL and
# React Router reads it, instead of being bounced to /.
#
# Read by Cloudflare Pages and Netlify. Vite copies public/ into the build output.
/*    /index.html   200
